<title>GERMANY: Buba allots 84.0 bln marks in tender at 3.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Buba allots 84.0 bln marks in tender at 3.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it allocated 84.0 billion marks of 14-day securities repurchase funds at this week's tender at 3.00 percent.</p>
<p>A 3.0 percent repo pact for 80.1 billion marks today, so a net 3.9 billion marks is flowing into the market.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank said banks bid for 311.6 billion marks of the repurchase funds this week. It accepted 26.95 percent of the bids made.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
